OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours to help shape sinking
OL,4,Ahomes plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of part of Guildford where
OL,7,Fproperties began sinking into the
OL,8,Fground is the subject of a council
OL,9,Fsurvey.
OL,11,FGuildford Borough Council is consulting
OL,12,Fresidents and businesses in the west of
OL,13,Fthe town about "opportunities for
OL,14,Ffuture improvements" in the
OL,15,Fneighbourhoods.
OL,17,FThe authority's Better Homes Programme
OL,18,Fhas already launched with the aim of
OL,19,Fimproving public spaces and
OL,20,Fcouncil-owned homes in the Westborough
OL,21,Fand Park Barn area.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
